# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
# ...but template/.vscode/ is payload, not this repo's editor settings: it ships
# `dart.flutterSdkPath` to generated projects. Without this negation `git add`
# skips it silently and the template renders without it. The directory itself
# has to be re-included — git does not descend into an excluded directory, so
# negating only the file inside would not work.
!template/.vscode/
*.iml
*.swp
*.swo

